# Track the reusable toolkit files.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/outputs/
/outputs/*
!/outputs/热点转发工具箱/
/outputs/热点转发工具箱/*
!/outputs/热点转发工具箱/先看这里.md
!/outputs/热点转发工具箱/hotspot-proxy.py
!/outputs/热点转发工具箱/启动透明代理.command
!/outputs/热点转发工具箱/维护/
/outputs/热点转发工具箱/维护/*
!/outputs/热点转发工具箱/维护/应急恢复普通热点.command

# Explicit sensitive/generated exclusions (also covered by the allowlist).
**/*.log
**/*.local.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/历史诊断/
**/运行记录/
/work/
